Welcome to the Alpha NT mail list!  This mail list is devoted to discussions
on Digital's Alpha systems running Microsoft's Windows NT operating system.
This mail list is hosted by Net Results on garply.com in Huntsville, Alabama, 
USA.

Here are some tips on using the mail list.

First, commands to majordomo MUST be in the body of the message -- the
subject line is NOT parsed!

To subscribe:
  Send an email from your mail account to majordomo@garply.com with the 
  following text in the body of the message:

	subscribe alphant

To unsubscribe:
  Send an email from your mail account to majordomo@garply.com with the
  following text in the body of the message:

	unsubscribe alphant

To get help on using the mail list:
  Send an email from your mail account to majordomo@garply.com with the
  following text in the body of the message:

	help

To send a message to all the users:
  Send an email from your mail account to alphant@garply.com with your
  message.

To send a message to the mail list administrators:
  Send an email from your mail account to Majordomo-Owner@garply.com.

And above all else, you must have fun!

Regards & enjoy the archive,
Aaron Sakovich
